  "description": "<s>{Written Guide: <i>{<rgb(162, 207, 251)>{https://maxroll.gg/poe2/build-guides/essence-drain-lich-build-guide}}\r\nLeveling Guide: <i>{<rgb(162, 207, 251)>{https://maxroll.gg/poe2/build-guides/essence-drain-lich-leveling-build-guide}}\r\n\r\n- <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Essence Drain} is comboed with <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Contagion} for Massive AoE Clear.\r\n- <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Dark Effigy} is comboed with <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Ravenous Swarm} and other Chaos DoT Debuffs for tons of Single Target Damage\r\n- Survive with a Large Energy Shield Pool, pseudo damage reduction via <rgb(5, 122, 240)>{Eternal Life}, heavily slowed enemies with <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Blasphemy} <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Temporal Chains}, and instantly recharge your Energy Shield with <rgb(27, 162, 155)>{Convalescence}}",
